Localization: No specific device shows faults; both edge interfaces (pc0 eth0 on segment E and pc12 eth0 on segment GG) are UP, and return traffic is symmetric.

Root cause: Not reproducible—current evidence shows no fault; any prior loss was likely transient during maintenance and has since cleared.

